"""Elemental version of HelloWorld.

   This variant is very elemental (sic)
   It does not even have protocols nor components -- the foundation of Castle.

   See the alternatives (like 'primitive') for more realistic examples of HelloWorld in Castle.
"""

@impliciet(Main)                   	///GAM: This `rewriter` auto-generates ``component Elemental_HelloWorld`` based on Main
implement Elemental_HelloWorld
{

HelloWorld(label :string) { 			///GAM: fixed `name :type` order
   print("Hello {label} World")
}

invoke() on self.std {
   HelloWorld("Elemental")
}

} /* Elemental_HelloWorld */


